| Rooted Tree | Tree DP |
| Subtree | Subtree DP |
| Choose / Skip Node | Include / Exclude |
| Longest Path | Path DP |
| Diameter | Height DP |
| Distance from every node | Rerooting DP |
| Independent Set | Include / Exclude |
| Ancestors | DFS State DP |

