# Standard State Definitions

## Single State

```
dp[node]
```

Meaning

```
Best answer

for subtree

rooted at node
```

---

## Two-State DP

```
dp[node][0]

dp[node][1]
```

Meaning

```
Not Choose

Choose
```

---

## Height DP

```
dfs(node)

returns

height
```

---

## Path DP

```
dfs(node)

returns

maximum gain
```

Global variable stores

```
maximum answer
```

---

