# Common Transformations

Many difficult tree problems reduce to one of these patterns.

```
Maximum Path
        ↓
Path DP

Choose / Skip
        ↓
Include / Exclude DP

Distance from Every Node
        ↓
Rerooting DP

Subtree Answer
        ↓
Subtree DP

Height
        ↓
Height DP
```

